{"data":[{"author_id":"38335898","created_at":"2026-10-16T01:41:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110908890976063787"],"id":"2110908890976063787","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1583,"like_count":5,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":2},"text":"1917年俄国布尔什维克革命的世界性恶果：\n\n1914年，俄罗斯帝国的总和生育率约为7.4，其出生人口占全球所有出生人口的约8%至12%。\n\n而如今，整个欧洲的总出生人口仅占全球的约4.5%。","url":"https://x.com/ZhangDajun/status/2110908890976063787"},{"author_id":"4911328046","created_at":"2026-10-15T01:39:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110545945939308663"],"id":"2110545945939308663","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1113,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":0},"text":"中国史上最大的一波退休潮来了！\n\n1962年到1975年，中国连续14年每年出生人口超过2000万。\n\n如今这批人已经开始大规模退休了。\n\n2025年，中国60岁以上人口已经达到3.23亿，而全年出生人口只有792万。\n\n每年退休的人越来越多，而新出生的孩子却越来越少。","url":"https://x.com/chakmillion/status/2110545945939308663"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110553377411309568"]},"author_id":"1863100477434695681","created_at":"2026-10-15T02:08:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110553398793969972"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/SrmNzbCHMJ","end":191,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/eth999965582/status/2110553398793969972/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110553377411309568","start":168,"url":"https://t.co/SrmNzbCHMJ"}]},"id":"2110553398793969972","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":72,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"未来14年，每天退休6万，新增牛马仅3万！\n  \n因为中国即将迎来史上最大退休潮。\n\n    到2035年，每3个中国人中就有一位60岁以上老人\n\n  • 婴儿潮退休周期大约持续到2036年，年均退休大约2000万左右。\n  • 每年退休：6万 ×365≈2190万人/年  • 每年新增劳动力：3万 ×365≈1095万人/年  。 https://t.co/SrmNzbCHMJ","url":"https://x.com/eth999965582/status/2110553398793969972"},{"author_id":"46960725","created_at":"2026-10-15T02:05:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110552676324790556"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"Victor Davis Hanson: “The Democrats’ Plan Is WORSE Than You Think…”...","display_url":"youtu.be/H909SoOWlPk","end":147,"expanded_url":"https://youtu.be/H909SoOWlPk","images":[{"height":720,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2110142464388452352/Kkxsdt9D?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1280},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2110142464388452352/Kkxsdt9D?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":124,"status":200,"title":"Victor Davis Hanson: “The Democrats’ Plan Is WORSE Than You Think…”","unwound_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H909SoOWlPk&feature=youtu.be","url":"https://t.co/u2ur9IUyXA"}]},"id":"2110552676324790556","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":29,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"移民政策，誰來承擔代價？\n\n漢森（Victor Davis Hanson）主張加強邊境管理，關注薪資、住房與納稅人負擔。但影片中的「5,500萬」不能解讀為非法移民人數；外國出生人口也包括入籍公民與合法居民。\n\n支持依法管理，也要把數字說清楚。\n https://t.co/u2ur9IUyXA","url":"https://x.com/stclee/status/2110552676324790556"},{"author_id":"1860190288557539329","created_at":"2026-10-16T00:43:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110894277522051536"],"id":"2110894277522051536","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":567,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"明年是农历羊年。\n民间传说属羊的人命不好，于是很多夫妇争取把孩子生在今年。\n小区里、公园里，小婴儿的数量眼见着多起来。\n今年出生人口肯定比去年增加不少。\n至于明年，可能又是一个断崖式减少。","url":"https://x.com/ImYanBoss/status/2110894277522051536"},{"author_id":"2024357633285902337","created_at":"2026-10-16T13:00:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111079736747475263"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":108,"start":105,"tag":"人口"},{"end":114,"start":109,"tag":"中国经济"}]},"id":"2111079736747475263","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"国家统计局：2025年出生人口792万，1949年以来最少；同年死亡1131万。每走10个人，只来7个。60岁以上已占23%。今天出生的人数，决定20年后谁来工作、谁来交社保。人口拐点不是预测，已经写进了账本。#人口 #中国经济","url":"https://x.com/pacificowlsome/status/2111079736747475263"},{"author_id":"2092496672312250368","created_at":"2026-10-15T11:47:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110699016455606460"],"id":"2110699016455606460","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"宁波洪塘这样偏的地方，80几平还要100多万，我不明白是在支撑房价，5千一个月的工资？还是经济消费疲软的现状？还是出生人口的下滑？房价依然没有回归到自由市场中价格来，完全脱离现实。5千到1万的房价才符合宁波的收入状况，泡沫依然巨大，3年后房价必崩。","url":"https://x.com/ztw123456ztw/status/2110699016455606460"},{"author_id":"1589075289103273985","created_at":"2026-10-15T09:10:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110659455964852508"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/Sri_Ayudhya/st…","end":159,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/Sri_Ayudhya/status/2110309856070799537","start":136,"url":"https://t.co/c70synaiB2"}]},"id":"2110659455964852508","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":124,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"80億分の1は出生人口の多い中央アジアやアフリカばかりクローズアップされるけど、先進国の職業的な不安定さを知る機会になるしその中で日本は安定して働けて仕事も見つけやすく社会保障が整ってるありがたさを知れる\n最初にプレイした後一回だけ生まれた国で始められるモード要望したい https://t.co/c70synaiB2","url":"https://x.com/nuuko_phy/status/2110659455964852508"},{"author_id":"2058908844479434752","created_at":"2026-10-15T14:12:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110735571207541097"],"id":"2110735571207541097","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"刚刚查了一下2020年之前出生人口都是几千万，2020之后才大幅下降，那么也就是说未来17年就业环境会非常艰难。我已经见识到这个威力了，能找到的工作累死累活工资才两三千，关键还要扣我480的社保，我还要生活吃饭，一个月下来根本存不到什么钱，索性辞职躺平不干了🥲这就是俺的现状","url":"https://x.com/vestalbubble/status/2110735571207541097"},{"author_id":"2062378789502607360","created_at":"2026-10-16T00:16:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110887446212702529"],"id":"2110887446212702529","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":73,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"浙江去年出生人口35万?\n\n一个杭州男生拉了份结婚清单：彩礼、五金、重新装修、酒席烟酒，净掏75万，女方回礼1.2万外加父母背着60万外债。最后婚退了。 \n\n别天天讨论年轻人为什么不爱繁殖了。当婚姻从“两家合伙开公司”变成“单方面资产剥离”，不签合同、立刻止损，是普通人保住现金流最后的理智。","url":"https://x.com/Tigerwps/status/2110887446212702529"},{"author_id":"1449103717081370630","created_at":"2026-10-16T14:43:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111105858453241920"],"id":"2111105858453241920","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"2025年，中国全年出生人口仅792万人创下历史新低，在全球排名中位列第二，仅次于印度2310万。中国看似守住全球第二的位次，实则和尼日利亚、巴基斯坦的差距已经微乎其微，之前总觉得中国人口多是常态，现在看到新生儿占比跌到6%，人口负增长与少子老龄化加速的严峻现实，才意识到人口结构的变化真的离","url":"https://x.com/Rishav2924/status/2111105858453241920"},{"author_id":"2098773821973291008","created_at":"2026-10-16T12:44:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111075725885526458"],"id":"2111075725885526458","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":737,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"基本盘思维汇总\n中国经济差 → 都是美国打压，说明中国太强了\n中国经济好 → 东升西降，制度优势\n中国技术突破 → 遥遥领先，西方急了\n中国技术失败 → 西方封锁太坏了\n中国社会稳定 → 中国人最幸福，西方羡慕\n中国出现动荡 → 境外势力颜色革命\n外国经济差 → 资本主义走到末路\n外国经济好 →","url":"https://x.com/Peter90116/status/2111075725885526458"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110757701315686400","3_2110757701307219968","3_2110757701303099392","3_2110757701332426752"]},"author_id":"1200632406157299712","created_at":"2026-10-15T15:40:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110757708085239903"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/Iuxgje9H0C","end":194,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/jennywa83159925/status/2110757708085239903/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110757701315686400","start":171,"url":"https://t.co/Iuxgje9H0C"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/Iuxgje9H0C","end":194,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/jennywa83159925/status/2110757708085239903/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110757701307219968","start":171,"url":"https://t.co/Iuxgje9H0C"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/Iuxgje9H0C","end":194,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/jennywa83159925/status/2110757708085239903/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110757701303099392","start":171,"url":"https://t.co/Iuxgje9H0C"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/Iuxgje9H0C","end":194,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/jennywa83159925/status/2110757708085239903/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110757701332426752","start":171,"url":"https://t.co/Iuxgje9H0C"}]},"id":"2110757708085239903","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":20,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"佛州是国际买家全美第一的目的地；外来出生人口 10 年涨了 120 万（2013 年 380 万 → 2023 年 500 万）。\n国际买家目的地排名：#1 迈阿密，#4 奥兰多（全美前五），#7 坦帕（全美前十）。\n国际买家来源：45% 拉美和加勒比，18% 欧洲，18% 加拿大。\n加拿大买家兴趣在下降：国际线上看房流量占比从 2024 https://t.co/Iuxgje9H0C","url":"https://x.com/jennywa83159925/status/2110757708085239903"},{"author_id":"1897387881460850689","created_at":"2026-10-16T02:34:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110922392457322739"],"id":"2110922392457322739","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":517,"like_count":1,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"🔥【让人破防】中共国与欧美日台发达国家将永远保持落后80-100年以上的水平。不喜勿喷！\n\n中国当然还会进步，但进步不等于能追上日本？经济总量大不等于全面领先欧美日？别自欺欺人了！\n📉 2025年，中国出生人口仅792万，死亡人口1131万，一年净减少339万！\n🔬","url":"https://x.com/deutschw989/status/2110922392457322739"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110643631858360320","3_2110643631879303169","3_2110643631862472704"]},"author_id":"1135120566287921153","created_at":"2026-10-15T08:07:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110643772967280933"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/KmcPtLLNAh","end":108,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Alex_perception/status/2110643772967280933/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110643631858360320","start":85,"url":"https://t.co/KmcPtLLNAh"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/KmcPtLLNAh","end":108,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Alex_perception/status/2110643772967280933/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110643631879303169","start":85,"url":"https://t.co/KmcPtLLNAh"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/KmcPtLLNAh","end":108,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Alex_perception/status/2110643772967280933/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110643631862472704","start":85,"url":"https://t.co/KmcPtLLNAh"}]},"id":"2110643772967280933",